{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f80efc6fb30afd9f4d23c1942148c271d10c011815bba259b8a7575b69faae9f", "ja": "（ファンタジーな世界観の、百合子の新しい衣装が\n完成した。なかなか気に入ってくれているみたいだな）", "zh": "（百合子那套充满幻想世界风格的新服装做好了。看来她相当喜欢呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "f54c3d9099a8d7dfd61da1b31357d13c8313952542cb230e9b28ebe3ab5c2532", "ja": "私は今、ここに誓いを立てます。\n{$P$}さんの剣となり……。", "zh": "我现在就在这里立下誓言。成为{$P$}先生之剑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
