{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1003_p", "source_sha256": "558f77961d29a4265dd16720b830b6793d3961358a40d4a4027a036b2ac04e2f", "ja": "う、うん……。心強い宣誓で助かるよ。\nとにかく、衣装を気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "呃、嗯……。有你这番令人安心的宣言，真是帮大忙了。总之，看样子你挺喜欢这套服装的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "2e260be134c2b15a0558b989eccb09570d66850f323e62a9a72e42e50e3f455e", "ja": "はい！　思い描いていた通りの衣装で、\n想像の世界に引きこまれそうになりますけど……。", "zh": "是！这正是我心目中的服装，感觉都快要被吸进想象中的世界了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "fca4961c79e6b201c4c3b26de69213fc940ac970feb3a9d3bbc9cf4d80a841cc", "ja": "ここはしっかりと、\n自制心を持って耐えていこうと思います！", "zh": "我会保持自制，坚定地忍耐下去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1006_p", "source_sha256": "667322d2018fc84d9233009a571d1c2fe057df5f2952f4b383aa9173704ef2af", "ja": "おお、かなり強い意志を感じるな。\nまあでも、少しぐらいなら想像してもいいと思うけど。", "zh": "哦，能感受到你相当坚定的意志啊。\n不过嘛，我觉得稍微想象一下也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b44cbf80b6b44858036a463f4414ff3a7de186035eec8e1286640d6f5e062ca", "ja": "いえ、今回は……～～っ！　大丈夫ですっ！\n私には、そうしなければならない理由がありますから。", "zh": "不，这次……～～！我没事的！\n因为我，有着必须这样做的理由。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e734ecedbf473edd92d77ba5da1f888b1650bb40128613f84f5d47c797e0b0c6", "ja": "理由……？", "zh": "理由……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "5ecbc4828f5048ac7414426c37cf57db84c394365f61464b95abb6fa25eadde5", "ja": "はい。この間、学校の友達と本屋さんに行ったんです。\nそこにたまたま、私の写真集が置いてあって……。", "zh": "是的。前段时间，我和学校里的朋友一起去了书店。\n碰巧那里摆着我的写真集……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "a9c29223b3c26f535d5e348a2551dd67210b4425cc473a5837f03129acbdea82", "ja": "本当なら、誇らしいことのはずなのに\n恥ずかしいって思う自分に気づいてしまって……。", "zh": "明明应该是件值得骄傲的事，可我却发现自己居然觉得很害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "0d02019dca170ea8d172130f07c0201856d6b5abdcfc023e8103618e02a6b21c", "ja": "もしかしてそれは、心のどこかで\n私自身に、満足できてなかったからじゃないかなって。", "zh": "我心想，这会不会是因为在内心的某个角落，\n其实对自己还不够满意呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1be1c3defeb726cb6a62fc17cb97981a6f54fe2f61392a587ff6078906496a10", "ja": "そうか。いつも百合子は一生懸命、\n仕事を頑張ってくれてると思うけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。我觉得百合子一直都很努力，在认真做好工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "7b7974098147aba300bdf736e55d02a076d62ee2b58d510f5084b570e0baa7ab", "ja": "そうですね。でも、それだけじゃダメなんです。\nアイドルとして、もっと自覚しないと……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，光是这样还不够。\n作为偶像，还得更加自觉才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "e3f443b41e463b2b50d7ae89564122ce300b8ed91cf823d69e4e4b867ec2210c", "ja": "だから今回は、お仕事が終わるまで\n気を抜かないようにしようと思ったんです。", "zh": "所以这次，我想在工作结束之前都不能放松警惕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "2c1cca162d45b346b2543f790b4e5df609d9bfb24358ef29df9d7e7ce206b231", "ja": "応援してくれるみなさんに、\n自信をもって、私のお仕事を見てもらいたいから。", "zh": "因为我想充满自信地，\n把自己的工作成果展现给支持我的大家看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0634_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8c973184558e296c7f924ef6b95c5595588c0bbd7949f7ee821e700098e5aa1a", "ja": "そうか。百合子の覚悟、応援するよ。百合子が、\n想像の世界に行きそうになったら引き止めないと。", "zh": "这样啊。我会支持百合子的决心。要是百合子快要跑进想象的世界里了，我可得把你拉回来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
